{"id":"bfaeda4e7d4809c2","group":"73","path":"73/73-ex-nonprime-counter-code-collision.md","title":"用非互异素数编码会丢失计数信息","display":"ex-nonprime-counter-code-collision — 用非互异素数编码会丢失计数信息","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-ex-nonprime-counter-code-collision","aliases":["73-ex-nonprime-counter-code-collision"],"display":"ex-nonprime-counter-code-collision — 用非互异素数编码会丢失计数信息","depends_on":["[[73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.5.4 boxed discussion, print p. 361; PDF p. 383","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-ex-nonprime-counter-code-collision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-ex-nonprime-counter-code-collision</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-nonprime-counter-code-collision — 用非互异素数编码会丢失计数信息"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1d0bc84062e5d0c\" href=\"?note=e1d0bc84062e5d0c\" title=\"73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code\">73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.5.4 boxed discussion, print p. 361; PDF p. 383"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；本例的候选函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(F:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(i,j,k)\\coloneqq2^i3^j4^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(i,j,k)\\coloneqq2^i3^j4^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(0,1,1)=12=F(2,1,0)\\land(0,1,1)\\ne(2,1,0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(0,1,1)=12=F(2,1,0)\\land(0,1,1)\\ne(2,1,0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>4 与 2 共用素因子，因此 k 的一单位可与 i 的两单位混淆；尤其无法从 12 判定第一计数器是否为零。互异素数条件承担单射与零测试两项义务。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code","status":"resolved","id":"e1d0bc84062e5d0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-prime-exponent-counter-code]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i,j,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F(i,j,k)\\coloneqq2^i3^j4^k.","display":true},{"tex":"F(0,1,1)=12=F(2,1,0)\\land(0,1,1)\\ne(2,1,0).","display":true}],"bytes":1186,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-ex-nonprime-counter-code-collision|用非互异素数编码会丢失计数信息]] （本轮新建）"}],"outgoing":["e1d0bc84062e5d0c"]}